 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Local compatibility experiment: ABI 11.20 appends explicit client-world
+  event subscriptions through `Load::on_client_raw_game_event` and
+  `typed::EventType::on_client`. The existing event-merge route keeps client
+  and hosted-server callbacks and batches separate. Client observations
+  have bounded copy/traversal budgets and may be dropped; no passive UI
+  selection semantics or server-world authority is inferred.
+
